WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.073
Daniel EA Daniel is the executive assistant He organises

00:00:05.126 --> 00:00:09.534
the administrative plan keeps the current status clear prepares

00:00:09.586 --> 00:00:13.810
options and follows up agreed actions When an approval

00:00:13.823 --> 00:00:16.849
is missing he records the gap rather than treating

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:17.968
it as a decision
